    "chunk_text": "(i) acquires the interest in the collateralunder a transaction that does notsecure payment or performance ofan obligation; and\n\n`\n\n6Secured Transactions\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(ii) gives value without knowledge of thesecurity right.\n\nPART II\n\n6.(1) There shall be established an Authority called theSecured Transactions Registration Authority (hereinafter inthis Act referred to as the \u201cAuthority\u201d).\n\n(2) The Authority shall, by the name assigned to it bysubsection (1), be a body corporate and shall have perpetualsuccession and a common seal and may sue and be sued inits corporate name.\n\n7.The objective of the Authority shall be to promotethe interests of the national economy by facilitating andparticipating in the regulation of secured transactions inmovable property, in compliance with the provisions of thisAct.\n\n8.(1) The administration and management of the affairsof the Authority shall be vested in a Board of Directors(hereinafter in this Act referred to as the \u201cBoard\u201d), consistingof the following members:-\n\n(a)the Governor of the Central Bank of Sri Lanka whoshall be the Chairman of the Board, or a personnominated by him as his representative;\n\n(b)the Secretary to the Treasury or a person nominatedby him as his representative;\n\n(c)the Chairman and a Director of the Bureau or personsnominated by them as their representatives; and\n\n(d)the Registrar of the Authority appointed undersection 16 of this Act.30\n\nEstablishmentof theSecuredTransactionsRegistrationAuthority.\n\nObjective oftheAuthority.\n\nBoard ofDirectors oftheAuthority.\n\n7Secured Transactions\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(2) The Registrar shall be the Secretary to the Board andshall be responsible for maintaining a record of the minutesof all meetings of the Board.\n\n9.The duties and functions of the Board shall be-\n\n(a)to register security rights of movable propertyunder Part VI of this Act;\n\n(b)to register the rights of judgment creditors;\n\n(c)to determine the policies related to theregistration system maintained by the Bureau;"
