    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of October 11, 2019\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 15.10.2019)\n\nLAND (RESTRICTIONS ON ALIENATION)(AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the Land (Restrictions on Alienation)\n\nAct, No. 38 of 2014\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Finance\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends section 3 of the Land (Restrictions on Alienation) Act, No. 38 of2014 and the legal effect of the section as amended is to extend the application of the exemptiongranted for land transactions under paragraph (i) of that section, to relevant companies which haveacquired lands prior to April 1, 2018.\n\n1Land (Restrictions on Alienation) (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 34/2019\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE LAND (RESTRICTIONS ON ALIENATION)ACT, NO. 38 OF 2014\n\nBe it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Land (Restrictions onAlienation) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.\n\n2.Section 3 of the Land (Restrictions on Alienation)Act, No. 38 of 2014 is hereby amended in subsection (1) bythe repeal of paragraph (i) and the substitution therefor ofthe following paragraph:\u2014\n\n\u201c(i)any land, the title of which is transferred, to acompany referred to in paragraph (b) of subsection(1) of section 2, listed in the Colombo StockExchange.\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between theSinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shallprevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof section 3of Act, No.38 of 2014.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\nLand (Restrictions on Alienation) (Amendment)2\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
