    "chunk_size_bytes": 1819,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon.Wijepala Hettiarachchi, M.P. for Galle District on 08th of October, 2019\n\n(Published in the Gazette on July 29, 2019)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 302]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nLIONS CLUBS INTERNATIONAL DISTRICT 306A -NATIONAL DEVELOPMENT FOUNDATION TRUST(INCORPORATION) (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Lions Clubs International District 306A - NationalDevelopment Foundation Trust (Incorporation) Act, No. 28 of 1986\n\nLions Clubs International District 306A - National Development Foundation Trust(Incorporation) (Amendment)\n\n1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE LIONS CLUBS INTERNATIONAL DISTRICT306A- NATIONAL DEVELOPMENT FOUNDATION TRUST(INCORPORATION) ACT, NO. 28 OF1986\n\nWHEREAS the Corporate members of the Lions ClubsInternational District 306A - National DevelopmentFoundation Trust (Incorporation) incorporated under theLions Clubs International District 306A - NationalDevelopment Foundation Trust (Incorporation) Act, No. 28of 1986 have passed a resolution to amend the name of saidTrust:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Trust, for the purpose of giveneffect to the said resolution, has applied to change the nameof such Trust; and it will be expedient to grant suchapplication:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Lions Clubs InternationalDistrict 306A - National Development Foundation Trust(Incorporation) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2019."
  },
