    "chunk_text": "(b)provide infrastructure facilities for designatedeconomic development zones including roads,water supply, housing and such other facilities andamenities as required by any economicdevelopment projects, plans, programmes orschemes formulated under section 18;\n\nPowers,functions andduties of theCorporation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n3Ruhunu Economic Development Corporation ofSri Lanka\n\n(d)accept grants, gifts or donations from persons orbodies of persons, in or outside Sri Lanka;\n\n(e)establish and enhance the co-operation betweeninter-agencies of every ministry, department,provincial council, provincial ministry anddepartment and local authority and other personsor body of persons whether private or public incarrying out studies and implementation ofeconomic development projects, plans, programmesor schemes;\n\n(f)implement the economic development projects,plans, programmes or schemes in the designatedeconomic development zones;\n\n(g) secure the participation of foreign and local privatesector agencies in carrying out detailed studies andimplementation of economic development projects,plans, programmes or schemes in the designatedeconomic development zones;\n\n(h)administer the designated economic developmentzones;\n\n(i)maintain any office or stores outside the designatedeconomic development zones and execute outsidesuch designated economic development zones anysuch work as may be necessary;\n\n(j)communicate the activities undertaken by theCorporation to the public ;\n\n(k)secure and obtain technical and financial assistance;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n4Ruhunu Economic Development Corporation ofSri Lanka\n\n(l)secure local and foreign collaboration for carryingout studies and implementation of economicdevelopment projects, plans, programmes orschemes in the Area;"
