    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nEXCISE (AMENDMENT)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Finance and Mass Media on 19th of July, 2018\n\n(Published in the Gazette on June 22, 2018)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nto amend the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 260]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 30 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect as amended is to expand theCategories of persons required to keep instruments.\n\nClause 3 : This clause amends section 32 of the principal enactment and the legal effectas amended is to empower the Minister to make rules for the issue of security features to beaffixed on an excisable article and to levy charges for the provision of such security features,with a view to eliminate any revenue loss from duties on an excisable article.\n\nExcise (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 21/2018\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE EXCISE ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 52)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Excise (Amendment)Act, No. of 2018.\n\n2.Section 30 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52)(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended as follows:\u2014\n\n(1)in subsection (1) by the substitution for the words\u201cEvery person who manufactures or sells excisablearticle under a licence\u201d of the words \u201cEvery personwho imports, exports, transports, manufactures,sells, possess or stores any excisable article under alicence, permit or pass;\n\n(2)in the marginal note to that section for the words\u201ccertain licensees\u201d of the words \u201cholder of a licence,permit or pass\u201d."
